== Isolation level setup + single-session demo ==
==================================================================
  04_isolation_levels.sql
  Demonstrates READ COMMITTED, REPEATABLE READ, SERIALIZABLE.
  
  This file is a GUIDE. After the SETUP block below has run,
  open TWO psql terminals and follow the >>> Terminal A/B <<<
  labels for each demo.
==================================================================

